@startuml
skin rose
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title Per-tab LSP document lifecycle

[*] --> NotTracked : unsupported / disabled
[*] --> Closed : supported, not yet opened

NotTracked --> Closed : becomes supported

Closed --> Open : didOpen
Closed --> Closed : server unavailable

state "Open" as Open {
  [*] --> Clean
  Clean --> Dirty : edit (didChange)
  Dirty --> Dirty : edit (didChange)
  Dirty --> Clean : save (didSave)
}

Open --> Closed : tab close (didClose)
Closed --> [*] : shutdown
NotTracked --> [*] : shutdown

note bottom of Open
  These states are per-*tab*. The underlying
  client is shared across tabs by
  (server_kind, workspace_root); a tab switch
  may just pick a different client, not
  respawn one.
end note

@enduml
